      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I need help with a work email. We just got the monthly invoice from our resin supplier, but the quantity they billed us for doesn't match what we actually received in the shipment. Can you draft a professional email to them asking for a credit memo to fix the overcharge and asking them to explain why the discrepancy happened? Thanks.",
